        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**REAL** \u2014 Apollo People Enrichment is attempted first; Hunter Domain Search is the fallback. Resolution tier and observed provider units are logged. The MX check is a lightweight DNS MX lookup, not a full SMTP handshake. Set `PILOT_MODE=fixture` for deterministic pilot data.",
        "height": 240,
